The '''Yeti Rod''' was an {{Epic}} [[Fishing Rod]]. It required {{skill|fishing|XXV}} to use. It increased the [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] of [[Sea Creatures#Winter|Winter Sea Creatures]] by {{Green|100%}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Yeti Rod''' had a {{Green|2%}} chance to be obtained from killing a {{MobSprite|Yeti}}.

